{
 "about": "Every Ink Tools icon on the tablet, built from Tabler Icons outline glyphs (design/icons/tabler.json, MIT, NOTICE.md): each icon names one Tabler glyph for its meaning, or places two or more (a glyph's `scale` about the 24 grid's origin, then `at`, its offset). icons.py scales each icon so its outline spans the native icons' share of the box, centred; a plugin icon is written on the 24 grid with native.json's padding and stroke, so its stroke and margin are the native toolbar icons'; an app's launcher icon is the same drawing doubled onto the native launcher icons' 48 grid. scripts/icons.py writes each SVG and 96 px PNG (plugins) or vector XML (apps) from this file (#271).",
